    "### Solutions Explored in This Work\n",
    "\n",
    "**1. Transfer Learning (Chapter 3)**\n",
    "- **Reuse knowledge** across similar motor types\n",
    "- **Reduce data requirements** by 60-80%\n",
    "- **Leverage pre-trained models** as starting points\n",
    "- **Domain adaptation** for specific motor configurations\n",
    "\n",
    "**2. Efficient Sampling Strategies**\n",
    "- **Latin Hypercube Sampling** for optimal space coverage\n",
    "- **Adaptive sampling** focused on promising regions\n",
    "- **Multi-fidelity approaches** mixing detailed and simplified simulations\n",
    "- **Active learning** to select most informative samples\n",
    "\n",
    "**3. Reinforcement Learning (Chapters 4-5)**\n",
    "- **Learn directly from environment interaction**\n",
    "- **No pre-computed dataset required**\n",
    "- **Data generation integrated with learning**\n",
    "- **Focused exploration** of design space"
   ]
